  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759160,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Rooms of Enemies: A Super Nintendo Challenge\n\nPrepare for a relentless test of skill and reflexes in *100 Rooms of Enemies*, a frantic, arcade-inspired platformer for the Super Nintendo! Inspired by the beloved \"Pit of 100 Trials\" from the Paper Mario series, this game throws you into a gauntlet of 100 increasingly challenging rooms, each teeming with unique and devious enemies.\n\nForget lengthy narratives – your goal is simple: survive. Each room presents a new, randomly generated setup, demanding quick thinking and precise jumps. Die repeatedly, learn from your mistakes, and strive to improve your record. Mastering the game isn't just about reaching Room 100; it's about perfecting your technique and pushing your limits.\n\nAs you conquer each room, you'll unlock clues hinting at a mysterious reward awaiting those who reach the final chamber. What secrets lie beyond Room 100, and what skills must you hone to claim them? *100 Rooms of Enemies* offers a pure, addictive gameplay loop perfect for seasoned platforming veterans and newcomers alike. Can you conquer the challenge?"
    },
